# Keep the Docker build context small. The image needs backend code, the ingestion
# SOURCES (jsonl + txt/md corpus the seed rebuilds from), scripts, and deploy/.
# NOTE: do NOT blanket-exclude *.md — some figures' corpus is markdown (e.g.
# franklin/biography.md). Only exclude persona drafts, which the seed doesn't read.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
backend/venv
frontend
node_modules
.git
.github
.env
**/.env
assets
docs
evals
tools
.playwright-mcp
**/persona/*.md
*.png
*.jpeg
*.jpg
*.log
